      "title": {
        "en": "Compassionate and dedicated veterinary team"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners frequently praise the veterinarians, technicians, and front desk team for their attentive, empathetic bedside manner. Doctors like Dr. Ogishi, Dr. Solomon, Dr. England, and Dr. Simpson receive frequent appreciation for their thorough examinations and clear guidance. A rare complaint noted rigid fee policies during an urgent consult, but the vast majority of clients express deep trust in the team."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 15,
      "title": {
        "en": "Fear-free handling for anxious pets"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers repeatedly highlight the clinic's gentle and fear-free approach when examining nervous, reactive, or senior dogs and cats. Many clients emphasize that staff take the time to build trust and tailor visits with treats or careful sedation so pets feel calm. One reviewer felt unsupported when seeking low-cost emergency care, but most report exceptional patience with fearful animals."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "communication",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 8,
      "title": {
        "en": "Responsive follow-ups and clear updates"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients consistently commend the clinic for prompt and thorough communication by phone and email. Pet parents appreciate that veterinarians and technicians call after appointments and lab results to explain findings in detail and check on healing pets. Reviewers also mention receiving clear instructions and helpful support when coordinating medical paperwork or travel health certificates."
      }
    }
  ],
